@startuml
!include _theme.puml
title GatoPago V3 — Recuperación cuando GatoPago desaparece

actor "Persona" as person
participant "Portable Account Package" as account_package COLOR_DATA
participant "Emergency client / CLI\nopen source local" as emergency COLOR_READY
participant "Signer independiente\nECDSA / Ed25519 / multisig" as signer COLOR_EXTERNAL
participant "RPC / bundler público" as rpc COLOR_EXTERNAL
participant "Cuenta EVM V3" as evm COLOR_EXTERNAL
participant "Cuenta Stellar C..." as stellar COLOR_EXTERNAL

note over person,stellar
  App API, Payments, Firebase, dominios,
  paymaster y bundler GatoPago están apagados.
end note

person -> emergency : importa package y manifests públicos
emergency -> account_package : verifica firmas, generation y codehashes
account_package --> emergency : redes + seguridad + deployments
emergency -> rpc : lee estado onchain de cada cuenta
rpc --> emergency : nonces/sequence, signers, assets, TTL

person -> signer : autoriza recuperación u operación
signer --> emergency : firma independiente del dominio GatoPago

alt EVM
  emergency -> emergency : construye UserOperation/tx self-funded
  emergency -> rpc : simula y envía
  rpc -> evm : validate + execute
  evm --> emergency : receipt confirmado
else Stellar
  emergency -> emergency : restaura TTL si hace falta\ny simula XDR/auth entries
  emergency -> rpc : envía transacción self-funded
  rpc -> stellar : __check_auth + ejecución
  stellar --> emergency : ledger/meta confirmado
end

person -> emergency : conservar cuenta o barrer activos
emergency --> person : evidencia exportable

note over signer
  Un JSON o una segunda passkey bajo el mismo
  RP ID no sustituyen este control independiente.
end note

@enduml
